Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 21:16:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Block off theora support in ogg parsing

We haven't supported this for sometime now and there are issues
which are still reachable with it enabled.

Bug: 582416731
Change-Id: Ib7c14214b7b689f8e50cd1f8b1a29c81535458de
Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/third_party/ffmpeg/+/8792676
Reviewed-by: Thomas Guilbert <tguilbert@chromium.org>
